  "garis-uncle-wiggilys-story-book": "PG 60625, Uncle Wiggily's Story Book: its copyright line reads MCMXXI and MCMXXXIX (1921 and 1939). The 1939 printing may carry material first published that year, so it is held back for Adam rather than added on Gutenberg's clearance alone.",
